<title>ROMANIA: Romania unemployment 5.9 pct vs 6.2 pct.</title>
<headline>Romania unemployment 5.9 pct vs 6.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BUCHAREST 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Romania's jobless rate fell to 5.9 percent in September from 6.2 percent the previous month, the Labour Ministry said on Monday.</p>
<p>Ministry sources said unemployment dropped further due to seasonal work in agriculture and construction.</p>
<p>				 SEPTEMBER   AUGUST   SEPTEMBER 1995</p>
<p> Number unemployed	 664,634     692,561   1.038 million</p>
<p> Pct of workforce	    5.9	    6.2	9.2</p>
<p>NOTE -- Romania's workforce is 11.235 million. The jobless rate is seen slipping to 8.3 percent in 1996 from 8.9 percent in 1995, with the private sector seen absorbing some unemployment. -- Bucharest Newsroom 40-1 3120264</p>
</text>
